# Resolution is offline and follows the documented precedence.

```console
$ LLLM_MODEL=openai/gpt-5 lllm resolve
openai/gpt-5

$ LLLM_MODEL=openai/gpt-5 lllm resolve --model-query sonnet
anthropic/claude-sonnet-5

$ LLLM_MODEL=openai/gpt-5 lllm resolve --model anthropic/claude-sonnet --model-query missing
anthropic/claude-sonnet-5

$ lllm resolve --model claude-sonnet
anthropic/claude-sonnet-5

```
